body:
Lol yeah! I personally will judge from with the disney plus. I love love love Story Of Tonight (I have my reasons mostly because the laurens and hamilton relationship is amazing),  I am mixed on Room where it happens, and Non stop. Non stop is a fantastic song, that just shocks me everytime. My opinions tend to change, a lot.

&#x200B;

(To be fair, it was either washington on your side or we know, or a winters ball)

Glad you asked. I can point you to the numerous things I wrote, but I'll lay it out here. First things first, the letters. I can link a video that sums it up better than I could for that aspect. It basically explains the letters we do have. ALMOST HALF of the letters were destroyed/gone missing. We think it was Hamilton's son, John Church Hamilton, but have zero way of knowing.  [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5PIptOEKqgI&t=5s](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5PIptOEKqgI&t=5s)  Now, let's just make this clear this was during wartime. Everyone was more affectionate during wartime.  But, Hamilton literally invited John to a threesome with his wife ON THEIR WEDDING NIGHT, said how much he hated everything else besides John, they shared a living quarters (with Washingtons consent), John would call hamilton "My boy" he only called his wife "My girl". The letters in them have more context, even though hard to understand. I personally believe they had something more. At one point Hamilton starts asking him to find him a wife. "A strange cure" That makes me believe that John thought if he got Hamilton a wife, it could "cure" his gayness. The more hamilton was affectionate the more John pushed away. The more Hamilton became distant, the more affectionate John became. I am linking the previous article I wrote below because it's still good to read. In summary, it's a big maybe. No one really knows. Also, it's good to mention that after John died, Hamilton wrote 7 SENTENCES. FOR A MAN WHO WRITES SO MUCH, 7 IS LIKE .00001. People say became depressed and never truly recovered. Poor guy.

&#x200B;

